# Accepted findings for `trivy config`, each with its reason (ADR-08 3.3). Review them with the security owner.

# DIG-0001: a firewall rule allows inbound traffic from any address.
# Only ICMP (diagnostics, path-MTU) and port 80 (Let's Encrypt HTTP-01 and the public sites) are open to the world. SSH is never
# open to the world: the module refuses 0.0.0.0/0 for admin_ssh_cidrs.
AVD-DIG-0001

# DIG-0003: a firewall rule allows outbound traffic to any address.
# omnisync makes 84 outbound calls to arbitrary hosts, including merchant URLs on arbitrary ports, and DigitalOcean drops ALL
# egress when a firewall has no outbound rule. Egress restriction is deferred until after hypercare (ADR-08 3.3).
AVD-DIG-0003
